    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d628-a1">

                <pb facs="0779" n="671" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg671"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Marquis Rudini to Baron Fava</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1891-03-20"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March 20,
                    1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Necessary the United States Government give us official communication that the
                    guilty of New Orleans massacres have been brought to justice. Moreover, you are
                    instructed to request indemnity, which, we trust, will be granted directly. A
                    simple declaration, though cordial and friendly, is not sufficient; we want
                    positive facts. Telegraph.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rudini</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
